    <cap:headline>Drought: YELLOW ALERT REMAINS IN FORCE FOR NIUE</cap:headline>
    <cap:description>Dry and windy conditions continue across Niue. Below-normal rainfall is forecast for the next three months, while strong winds may further increase the risk of bushfires.</cap:description>
    <cap:instruction>Use water wisely and avoid unnecessary water use. Avoid activities that could start a fire and follow the Yellow Alert and fire ban advice issued by NDMO.</cap:instruction>
    <cap:contact>Niue Meteorological Service</cap:contact>
